window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A high schooler searches for her dead best friend amidst an apocalyptic battle between heaven and hell in the second book of this horror LitRPG series.</b></p> <p><i>The Final Challenge has commenced. 7,885,246,104 humans remain.</i></p> <p>Against all odds, Jenny Huang is still alive. Or as alive as she can be. She escaped the Survival Challenge, a twisted game in which mortals must kill or be killed, but the nightmare didn't end there. By forcing the Challenge to a close and returning to Earth, Jenny has unwittingly unleashed chaos: birthing the Antithesis, kicking off Judgment Day, and dooming the world to a host of bloodthirsty angels.</p> <p>Worst of all, her best-friend-slash-crush, Susan, is dead. And it's all Jenny's—and her insatiable appetite's—fault. Now, armed with terrifying new powers and unlikely alliances with others caught in this divine drama, she slips between worlds in search of Death and salvation. But exhaustion and guilt threaten to unravel her sanity . . . and her very sense of self.</p> <p>To avoid complete annihilation by forces far more powerful than she can imagine, Jenny must confront her darkest desires and harness every last drop of strength she has left. With the worlds spinning out of control, there's only one question left to consider: How far is she willing to go in order to reunite with Susan and make amends?</p> <p><b>The second volume of the hit LitRPG fantasy series—with more than 400,000 views on Royal Road—now available in paperback, ebook, and audiobook!</b></p>"; 
